// Resources for tesmiolauncher.exe - at the moment, its icon.
//
// Windows shows the ICON resource with the **lowest id** as an executable's
// application icon, so this one is 1 and nothing else here may take a lower
// number.
//
// logo.ico is generated from logo.png and carries ten sizes, because Explorer,
// the taskbar, Alt-Tab and the title bar each pick a different one and a
// single-size icon gets scaled badly in at least two of those places:
//
//     python -c "from PIL import Image; \
//       Image.open('logo.png').convert('RGBA').save('logo.ico', format='ICO', \
//       sizes=[(16,16),(20,20),(24,24),(32,32),(40,40),(48,48),(64,64),(96,96),(128,128),(256,256)])"
//
// The path is relative to this file, which is what rc.exe resolves against.

1 ICON "..\\logo.ico"
